                      <X>4290.462</X>
                      <Y>145.78906</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">2f01b38e-0310-4c71-a51f-9c82a00c7587</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 1  -  One branch per floor
Goal: a data tree with every floor outline (and its centre
   point) in its own branch.
Idea: Graft puts each item in its own branch, so everything
   after it is processed floor by floor and kept separate per
   level.
Watch for: Graft both the outlines and the points, so the
   branches line up.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>4285.462</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>248.20557</W>
                          <H>90.78906</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>4290.462</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="76">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="13">
