                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">12</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">LEVEL C - Create the floors  |  C03 (Complex method)  |  Twisty tower series - WALKTHROUGH.  Units: feet.
One concept per stage. Every stage opens with a note:  Goal (what it makes)  -  Idea (the concept)  -  Watch for (common mistakes)  -  Wire check (which input a wire goes into).
GIVEN = built in an earlier level, pre-placed, not quizzed.  STEP n = quizzed: red C03_Q## is the question node.
Green _Correct = locked copy.  Blue _Choices = 12 locked wrong choices.  Built only from components the PathOGen solver supports.
Questions: C03_Q01 Graft Tree   C03_Q02 Scale   C03_Q03 Multiplication   C03_Q04 Unit Z   C03_Q05 Extrude   C03_Q06 Cap Holes   C03_Q07 Area</item>
